<view class="page"><navigation-bar title="照片定位地图" back="{{false}}" background="#ffffff" color="#1f2329"></navigation-bar><view class="top"><view class="search-box"><text class="search-icon">⌕</text><input class="search-input" value="{{kw}}" placeholder="搜索当前批次的序号或文件名" bindinput="onInput"/><text class="clear" wx:if="{{kw}}" bindtap="clear">×</text></view><view class="map-head"><view><text class="map-title">最近 {{batches.length}} / 20 次导入 · 当前 {{activeBatchCount}} 张</text><text class="map-sub">{{batchHint}}</text></view><view class="column-controls"><text class="column-button {{gridColumns === 3 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-columns="3" bindtap="setGridColumns">3列</text><text class="column-button {{gridColumns === 4 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-columns="4" bindtap="setGridColumns">4列</text><text class="column-button {{gridColumns === 5 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-columns="5" bindtap="setGridColumns">5列</text></view></view><scroll-view class="batch-scroll" scroll-x show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="batch-list"><text class="batch-button {{item.id === activeBatchId ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{batches}}" wx:key="id" data-batch-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectBatch">{{item.label}}</text></view></scroll-view><view class="selection-tip">最近 20 次导入可切换查看。建议一次选择相册中相邻的照片；之后按相同列数查看，就能用“第几行第几列”快速定位待清理照片。</view></view><scroll-view class="body" scroll-y show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="grid cols-{{gridColumns}}"><view class="map-card {{item.mapClass}}" wx:for="{{mappedPhotos}}" wx:key="id"><view class="image-wrap"><image class="photo" src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" data-src="{{item.path}}" bindtap="preview"></image><text class="sequence">{{item.sequenceText}}</text><text class="suggestion {{item.suggestionKind}}" wx:if="{{item.suggestionLabel}}" data-digest="{{item.suggestionDigest}}" data-batch-id="{{item.suggestionBatchId}}" bindtap="openDuplicateGroup">{{item.suggestionLabel}}</text></view><text class="location">{{item.locationText}}</text><text class="photo-meta">{{item.resolutionText}}</text><text class="group-link" wx:if="{{item.suggestionLabel}}" data-digest="{{item.suggestionDigest}}" data-batch-id="{{item.suggestionBatchId}}" bindtap="openDuplicateGroup">查看这一组 ›</text></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!mappedPhotos.length}}"><text class="empty-title">还没有可查看的导入记录</text><text class="empty-sub">从首页选择一组连续照片后，它们会按选择顺序显示在这里</text></view><view class="safe-space"></view></view></scroll-view></view>